    "sentence_translations": [
      "Ben’s Diary—Happy Independence Day",
      "",
      "Today is the 4th of July, Independence Day.",
      "Today is the birthday of the United States. Right now, I really miss my family.",
      "In the past, when it was Independence Day, Dad and Mom wouldn’t work.",
      "We would have a barbecue, drink beer, and sing songs together.",
      "If the weather was good, we would even go to the seaside, and everyone would be really happy.",
      "Right now, I’m not in the United States, so I can’t celebrate with them. I really miss them!"
    ]
